          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>Does Konnected work with Josh.ai?</h3><p>Yes, for garage door control. Konnected GDO blaQ and GDO White can be used for Josh.ai garage control when the opener and product path are compatible.</p><h3>Which Konnected garage door opener should I use with Josh.ai?</h3><p>Use GDO blaQ for supported Security+ / Security+ 2.0 Chamberlain-family openers. Use GDO White for compatible dry-contact or wired push-button opener paths. If you are not sure, compare the GDO family before buying.</p><h3>Should I ask my Josh.ai dealer before buying?</h3><p>Yes. If a Josh.ai dealer or installer manages the home automation system, involve them before buying so they can confirm opener compatibility, product choice, and the Josh.ai setup plan.</p><h3>Does this page cover Konnected Alarm Panels?</h3><p>No. This page is focused on garage door openers. Alarm Panel compatibility should be confirmed separately before it is added here.</p>",
